  "cited_article_id": "generate-and-submit-claims",
  "reply": "Open the **Validation Queue** tab in Claim Center, click each claim with the red error icon, correct the highlighted issues (e.g., missing modifiers, invalid subscriber IDs, unmapped diagnosis codes), and then click **Save & Re‑validate**. After all claims validate, select them and choose **Batch & Submit**. If errors persist despite correct data, verify the payer’s electronic format settings under **Billing > Payer Rules**, and review any rejection codes in the **Clearinghouse Log** under **Reports**. Also ensure claims are within 90 days of service and batch size does not exceed 500 claims."
}
